    "architecturalHeights": "Retained exact-QID way292349517/Q2001493 matches current main35184664438349 with height34.7m. Separate western bell35184706969661 has height15m. Raw plans/tags and missing min_height values are retained, without rescale. These approximate map envelopes are full cone/cross tips, not stacked wall solids. Picture-led main body eave10.8m/ridges14.3m, porch eave8.2m/roof10.1m, east apse roof13m, drum14.3..22.5m and metal cone22.5..33.5m/cross34.7m are estimates. Bell elevations are relative to its own standard-DEM center, not the cathedral datum. Bell base3.5m, middle6.5m, upper10m and stone cone14.3m/cross15m subdivide its envelope. The2018–2019 photographed conical-roof exterior is the explicit appearance scope; later restoration state is unverified. Boolean partitions round derived inputs to0.1mm; raw controls remain exact. Retained facts have no independent measured dimensions. Facade rhythm, porch and drum forms, reliefs and thresholds are approximate."
